cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "go-clikit: the shared runtime of GSI-HPC's command-line tools in Go"
abstract: >-
  Go packages that command-line tools share: progress reported as spans in
  a context, drawn as a live tree, a counter or plain lines for CI, and
  written to a JSONL event log; bounded worker pools that report their
  targets; and escaping untrusted text for a terminal.
authors:
